Package: bimResilience
Type: Package
Title: BIM Fisheries Resilience Analysis Tools
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("L.T.", "Kell", email = "l.kell@bim.ie", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Application layer for BIM fisheries resilience TAC scenarios.
    Constant-F projection and seasonal collapse use FLBacktest generics
    (shared with blueMarine); this package keeps SAG I/O, BIM scenario labels,
    and report glue.
